          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A vital artery connecting power regions is at the center of the action. The power system controller moved to protect this infrastructure after prolonged outages exposing grid weaknesses and extreme heat pushing demand to the edge strained the system. The emergency intervention to protect vital infrastructure was a critical step to prevent collapse, as rising blackout risks test grid resilience across the power-constrained region under red alert. Authorities are now forced to navigate this fragile new reality.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
